/*
 * Implements validation for the `__pragma!tag(sym, tag)` and
 * `__pragma!tags(sym, tag)` constructs.
 *
 * The pragmas read at compile time the arguments of the sites of a tag written
 * on top of the declaration of a symbol.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::pragma::tag_value
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/pragma/tag_value.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-11-03
